OL,3,GNEWSA'Redundant' chapel to become cafe
OL,4,Aand workspace
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn abandoned village chapel which has
OL,7,Fbeen empty for more than a decade will
OL,8,Fbe brought back into use as a cafe and
OL,9,Fco-working space.
OL,11,FThe Methodist Chapel in Tydd St Giles,
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, was last used in 2015,
OL,13,Faccording to DND Core who have
OL,14,Fsubmitted a planning application to
OL,15,Fredevelop the site.
OL,17,FThe applicant said the building would
OL,18,Foperate as a "community-focused
OL,19,Fco-working office space" as an
OL,20,Falternative to working from home - and
OL,21,Fwould have a mixed office and cafe.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
