OL,3,GNEWSA'Redundant' chapel to become cafe
OL,4,Aand workspace
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,7,FReporting Service, DND Core said the
OL,8,Fbuilding had been left "in a state of
OL,9,Fdecay" with "dry rot throughout the
OL,10,Ftimber ground floor, which has
OL,11,Fcollapsed in part".
